<view class="login-nav" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;">
  <view class="login-nav-bar">
    <button class="login-nav-back" plain="true" bindtap="leaveLogin" aria-label="返回首页">‹</button>
    <view class="login-nav-title">登录绑定</view>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="hero">
  <view class="eyebrow">欢迎来到学习小站</view>
  <view class="hero-title">绑定手机号，查看专属学习内容</view>
</view>
<view class="section">
  <view class="card login-card">
    <view class="mascot">🐣</view>
    <view class="title">开启今天的学习</view>
    <view class="sub">手机号仅用于匹配老师已开通的学生账号，绑定后即可查看专属学习内容。</view>
    <view class="form-line">
      <input value="{{form.studentName}}" data-field="studentName" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="学生姓名" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-line">
      <input value="{{form.schoolName}}" data-field="schoolName" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="学校（选填）" />
    </view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{gradeOptions}}" value="{{gradeIndex}}" bindchange="onGradeChange">
      <view class="form-line picker-line">
        <view class="picker-value {{form.grade ? '' : 'placeholder'}}">{{form.grade || '请选择年级'}}</view>
      </view>
    </picker>
    <button class="button" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="bindPhone" loading="{{binding}}" disabled="{{binding}}">绑定手机号</button>
    <button class="button light secondary-button" bindtap="leaveLogin" disabled="{{binding}}">返回首页</button>
    <view class="login-tip">暂不绑定也可以先浏览公开内容；专属学习内容由老师开通后自动显示。</view>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="section">
  <view class="bubble">账号被停用或暂未开通学习星球时，请联系老师或管理员处理。</view>
</view>
